## 3. GPU Test Framework: `/data/vela/frameworks/graphics/gpu_tools/gpu_test/gpu_fb_nuttx.c`

A clean, encapsulated framebuffer wrapper:

```c
struct gpu_fb_s* gpu_fb_create(const char* path)
{
    fb->fd = open(path, O_RDWR | O_CLOEXEC);

    if (ioctl(fb->fd, FBIOGET_VIDEOINFO, &fb->vinfo) < 0)
        goto failed;

    if (ioctl(fb->fd, FBIOGET_PLANEINFO, &fb->pinfo) < 0)
        goto failed;

    fb->memory = mmap(NULL, fb->pinfo.fblen, PROT_READ | PROT_WRITE,
        MAP_SHARED | MAP_FILE, fb->fd, 0);
}
```

The `gpu_fb_get_buffer()` function maps `vinfo.fmt` to color formats:
- `FB_FMT_RGB16_565` -> GPU_COLOR_FORMAT_BGR565
- `FB_FMT_RGB24` -> GPU_COLOR_FORMAT_BGR888
- `FB_FMT_RGB32` -> GPU_COLOR_FORMAT_BGRX8888
- `FB_FMT_RGBA32` -> GPU_COLOR_FORMAT_BGRA8888

