## 4. Brightness Service: `/data/vela/frameworks/runtimes/services/brightness/display.c`

Shows how to use `FBIOSET_POWER` and `FBIOGET_POWER`:

```c
static int write_brightness(struct display_brightness_s *display, int brightness)
{
    display->current = brightness;
    ioctl(display->fd, FBIOSET_POWER, brightness);
    return 0;
}

static int read_brightness(struct display_brightness_s *display, int *brightness)
{
    *brightness = display->current;
    ioctl(display->fd, FBIOGET_POWER, brightness);
    return 0;
}
```

Opens with `open(devpath, O_RDWR | O_CLOEXEC)`.

