## 8. Summary: `/dev/lcd0` vs `/dev/fb0`

| Aspect | `/dev/fb0` (framebuffer) | `/dev/lcd0` (LCD dev) |
|---|---|---|
| Header | `<nuttx/video/fb.h>` | `<nuttx/lcd/lcd_dev.h>` |
| Key ioctl for video info | `FBIOGET_VIDEOINFO` | `LCDDEVIO_GETVIDEOINFO` |
| Key ioctl for plane info | `FBIOGET_PLANEINFO` | `LCDDEVIO_GETPLANEINFO` |
| Pixel access | mmap the `fbmem` address (or `mmap()` syscall) | `LCDDEVIO_PUTAREA` / `LCDDEVIO_PUTRUN` |
| Double buffering | `FBIOPAN_DISPLAY` with `poll(POLLOUT)` + `poll(POLLIN)` for vsync | Not directly supported |
| Overlays | Yes, `FBIOGET_OVERLAYINFO` + overlay ioctls | No |

