| `CONFIG_SUNXI_DISP2_FB_ROTATION_SUPPORT` | `disp_display.c`, `dev_disp.c`, `include.h` | Controls **software per-layer rotation framework** (`disp_rotation_sw`) -- a virtual function table with no implementation present in this source tree. Likely provided as a pre-built library. |

